  {
   "id": "NoticeReference",
   "description": "One number or name a notice carries (a tracking, invoice, customer PO or item number, a free reference, a payer or partner name), read as its identifier kind (the links compare it under that kind; the value is text here, so no store-wide mention or identifier pass reads notices). Links to the notice and to the record the value names.",
