       "note": "sage.oe_shipment_header.shiptrack: the carrier tracking number Sage keeps on a shipment (the Portal's own app_shipment.tracking_number is empty on every row). Links 11-13: 4,254 notice references name exactly one Sage shipment; the notice arrived -3..60 days from the ship date for 97% of them against 10% of shuffled pairs."
      }
